    bottomLateral: ["S690 CHS33.7x2.6","S690 CHS42.4x3.2","S690 CHS48.3x3.2","S690 CHS60.3x3.2","S690 CHS60.3x4","S690 CHS76.1x4","S690 CHS88.9x4","S690 CHS114.3x4","S690 CHS139.7x5"],
